packages/dronecan-dsdl

src/generated/catalogue.ts is generated from the DroneCAN DSDL type
definitions (https://github.com/dronecan/DSDL), and the generator uses the
pydronecan DSDL parser (https://github.com/dronecan/pydronecan). Both are
distributed under the MIT License, reproduced below. The DSDL is used here as
data; the codec in src/ is this project's own (GPL-3.0-only), ported from the
behaviour of pydronecan's transport module.

